## Non-goals

- Automatic daemon launch or a default per-user socket path.
- Concurrent-start singleton selection, startup markers, stale artifact recovery, ownership/mode/symlink hardening, idle shutdown, or reconnect supervision.
- The 24-client/slow-reader/load proof and final production queue/write-buffer limits.
- Migrating OpenCode or Pi, or changing their current timers, controls, rendering, artwork, waveform, or lifecycle code.
- Native artwork requests or moving iTunes/Kitty work.
- Documentation updates, including the intentional HTML architecture document.
- Publishing, versioning, committing, pushing, opening a PR, or editing `.apnea/state.json`.
